            "review_title": "Review at MJC Wok Bar",
            "review_text": "Ryan C\nChicago, Illinois202 contributions\n0\nGood value breakfast\nAug 2016 • Friends\nThis place is pretty cheap, can get a plate of eggs, bacon and a toasted baguette with some salad for under 50k. They also do kebabs and other sandwiches for pretty cheap and they looked ok. The waitress was very friendly too. It's not a hugely filling portion but pretty decent if you have an early start, would recommend it for sure!\nWritten August 27, 2016",
